-- Drag a slider or enter a value; edits apply immediately. RESET restores launch values.
-- Shift: sprint (enable first). Q: dash. Space/Ctrl: flight altitude.
-- Settings persist across character respawns; saved positions are session-only.
-- No external downloads.
-- Run in a Roblox client Lua environment; in Studio use StarterPlayerScripts.
-- Not a universal game adapter. Server authority/custom controllers may override effects.
-- RightShift or floating DPM button: toggle. Drag header. Unload restores saved values.
